# Resource packs and audio are other people's work. They live on your
# machine, never in the repository and never in the published build:
#   assets/textures/  Prime's HD Textures (supporter download, all rights reserved)
#   assets/sounds/    Minecraft 1.12 audio (Mojang)
#   assets/skins/     whatever you drop in
# The engine paints its own fallbacks for all three, which is what
# browsercraft.net actually ships.
